第三方引用说明 / Third-party quotations

本仓库正文与表格中引自余光中《中文的常态与变态》《从西而不化到西而化之》《论中文之西化》的短语与例句，仅用于评论与举例。引文按篇目与节次标注，不标页码。这些引文的著作权属于原作者及其权利继受方，不在本文件 MIT 授权范围内。

本仓库与余光中著作权方无关联，未获其授权或背书。

Short phrases and examples quoted from Yu Guangzhong's three essays on Chinese prose appear throughout this repository for critical commentary and illustration. They are cited by essay and section, never by page number. Copyright in those passages stays with the author and his successors and is not covered by the MIT grant above.
